cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these measurements or this procedure, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "jpeg2000-benchmark: a reproducible procedure for measuring GPU JPEG 2000 codecs (fvJPEG2000 and nvJPEG2000 on an NVIDIA RTX 4090)"
version: "2026.09"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22811905
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/fastvideo/jpeg2000-benchmark"
url: "https://www.fastcompression.com/blog/fastvideo-vs-nvjpeg2000.htm"
abstract: >-
  Scripts, a measurement harness for NVIDIA nvJPEG2000 and raw logs for
  comparing two GPU JPEG 2000 codecs at the same compressed file size:
  fvJPEG2000 from Fastvideo SDK and nvJPEG2000 from NVIDIA, on an RTX 4090.
  Source code under MIT; measurement results and logs under CC BY 4.0;
  article snapshots under CC BY-ND 4.0.
authors:
  - given-names: Fyodor
    family-names: Serzhenko
    affiliation: Fastvideo
keywords:
  - JPEG 2000
  - J2K
  - GPU
  - CUDA
  - nvJPEG2000
  - benchmark
  - reproducibility
  - RTX 4090
